  "title": "Cockroach Protests in Delhi Amid Government Crackdown and Public Demand",
  "summary": "Thousands of demonstrators in Delhi have gathered at the PM's residence, demanding justice and opposing political misuse of privileges, while the government contested the protests and highlighted judicial oversight. The Supreme Court dismissed a plea against a public figure’s renovation, and protesters continue to demand accountability.",
